  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v26.7.0 - large update.\n\nNew: real PDF<->SVG conversion, Markdown save/load, document Comparison (Diff), PDF 3D annotation reading, dynamic XFA flatten rendering.\nText: CR/LF line structure, RTL/bidi and CJK extraction, ligatures, post-replace reflow.\nRendering/images: image alt-text, inline-image enumeration, DPI-preserving XImage.Save, improved TIFF/JPEG/JBIG2/CCITT handling.\nAlso: fonts, Forms/AcroForm/XFA, signatures (SHA-1/DSA/ECDSA, LTV, DocMDP), PDF/A and save/optimize improvements.\n\nFull release notes: https://github.com/aspose-pdf-foss/Aspose.PDF-FOSS-for-.NET/releases/tag/v26.7.0",
